msgstr "De skrivna sökvägarna."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/isScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether `platform` is a known [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) or one of its aliases (e.g. `html`)."
msgstr "Om `platform` är en känd [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) eller en av dess alias (t.ex. `html`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Skapa en startprojektstomme för en plattform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), och installera pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) i samma katalog."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "En [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "Målkatalogen (standard `\".\"`). Dess basename (eller `\"pantoken-app\"` för `\".\"`)\n  ersätts för `{{projectName}}` i scaffoldets mallfiler."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "Vilka agentverktygets resurser som ska installeras tillsammans med scaffolden (standard `\"all\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "De skrivna sökvägarna, scaffoldfiler först."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter with every agent asset installed**"
msgstr "**Scaffolda en React-startmall med alla agentresurser installerade**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Skapa ett startprojekt för en plattform, med pantoken redan installerat och anslutet."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Målmappen (standard `\".\"`). Dess basename (eller `\"pantoken-app\"` för `\".\"`)\n  ersätter `{{projectName}}` i mallfilerna."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the generated markup's\n  `lang`/`dir` attributes."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` välj vilka `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (standard `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), tillämpas över alla plattformar. `cdn` väljer CDN\n  leverantör `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` är byggda för (standard jsDelivr);\n  ignoreras av alla andra plattformar. `locale` (standard `\"en\"`) sätter den genererade markupens\n  `lang`/`dir` attribut."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter**"
msgstr "**Skapa en React-startmall**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/ai` — consumer-facing agent assets for projects that *use* pantoken (not for\ndeveloping pantoken itself)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/ai` — kundvända agentresurser för projekt som *använder* pantoken (inte för\natt utveckla pantoken själv)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships an `AGENTS.md`, an `llms.txt`, editor/agent rule files (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), and\nClaude Code skills (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), plus [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI to drop them into a consumer repo at the\nconventional paths."
msgstr "Det levereras med en `AGENTS.md`, en `llms.txt`, redigerar-/agentregel-filer (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), och\nClaude Code-färdigheter (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), samt [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / `pantoken-ai`-CLI:t för att placera dem i ett konsumentrepo på de\nkonventionella sökvägarna."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Asset content and the writer function now live in `@pantoken/scaffold` (so the base scaffold\nflow can offer them without a circular dependency); re-exported here for back-compat."
msgstr "Tillgångens innehåll och skrivarfunktionen finns nu i `@pantoken/scaffold` (så att basstommen\nflöde kan erbjuda dem utan ett cirkulärt beroende); återexporteras här för bakåtkompatibilitet."

