msgstr "Det högsta staplingsdjupet (överlägg, menyer)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — Tabellens dataradgrupp (InstUI `Table.Body`)."

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Modifieraren `-layout-stacked` på föräldern `table` ändrar stilen för denna medlem — se `table`s egen dokumentation för den här modifieraren."

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — En datacell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."

#: css/table.cell.md css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Förälderns `table`'s `-layout-stacked`-modifierare staplar denna medlem som ett block och märker den via `::before` — se `table`s egen dokumentation för den modifieraren."

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — En kolumnrubrikcell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); standard `th`-stil, överskriven av `table.row-header` för `th[scope=\"row\"]`."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — Tabellens rubrikradsgrupp (InstUI `Table.Head`)."

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Den överordnade `table`'s `-layout-stacked`-modifierare döljer detta element visuellt (dess kolumnrubriker visas istället per cell) — se `table`'s egen dokumentation för den modifieraren."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — En stylad datatabell för `th` och `td` samt en valfri bildtext, med hover-, fast- och staplad-kort-layout."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "För `-layout-stacked` kan ren CSS inte föra varje kolumnrubriks text in i dess cell, så ge varje cell en `data-label` och det staplade kortet visar den via `::before`. Se medlemmarna `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header` och `table.row-header` för de enskilda delarna."

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "Märk tabellen med en `<caption>`, markera kolumnrubriker som `<th scope=\"col\">` och radrubriker som `<th scope=\"row\">`, och i `-layout-stacked` ge varje cell en `data-label` eftersom rubrikraden är visuellt dold."

