#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — En enskild flikknapp (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, konfigurerad via föräldern `Tabs`'s fliklista); `-selected` markerar den aktiva."

