msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "Föräldern `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary`-modifier omstilar detta element till en rundad \"mapp\"-flik — se `tabs`'s egen dokumentation för den modifieraren."

#: css/tabs.tab.md
