msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens become `COLOR`\nvariables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else `STRING`. Icons are\nexcluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\nplugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has the plugin glue."
msgstr "Den genererar en variabelkollektion med `light`/`dark`-lägen: färgtoken blir `COLOR`\nvariabler (RGBA 0–1), dimensioner/nummer blir `FLOAT`, allt annat `STRING`. Ikoner är\nuteslutna (de skulle vara Figma-komponenter, inte variabler). Skicka [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) till en Figma\nplugin (Variables plugin-API) eller Variables REST API — README innehåller plugin-integrationen."

