msgstr "Teckensnittsark. Standard är [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
