msgstr "Rust-källkoden (en modul av `pub const`s)."

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**egui (Color32), the default format**"
msgstr "**egui (Color32), standardformatet**"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**iced (Color), dark mode**"
msgstr "**iced (Color), mörkt läge**"

#: platforms/rust/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/rust` — emit Instructure design tokens as Rust constants for the two mainstream native\nRust GUIs: **egui** (`Color32`) and **iced** (`Color`). Colours become the framework's colour\ntype; dimensions become `f32` (px). Web-rendered Rust UIs (Tauri, Dioxus-web, Leptos, Yew) should\nuse `@pantoken/css` instead."
msgstr "`@pantoken/rust` — avger Instructure designtokens som Rust-konstanter för de två mainstream native\nRust-GUI:erna: **egui** (`Color32`) och **iced** (`Color`). Färger blir ramverkets färgtyp;\ndimensioner blir `f32` (px). Web-renderade Rust-GUI:er (Tauri, Dioxus-web, Leptos, Yew) bör\nistället använda `@pantoken/css`."

#: platforms/rust/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateRust](functions/generateRust.md)"
msgstr "Byter namn på och exporterar om [generateRust](functions/generateRust.md)"

#: platforms/rust/src/interfaces/RustOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [toRust](../functions/toRust.md) / [generateRust](../functions/generateRust.md)."
msgstr "Alternativ för [toRust](../functions/toRust.md) / [generateRust](../functions/generateRust.md)."

#: platforms/rust/src/interfaces/RustOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
