msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — the `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\ntokens behind InstUI's `Transition` utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — de `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\ntokenerna bakom InstUI:s `Transition` verktyg."

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS itself (the `.instui-transition` base rule plus the `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*` state classes)\nlives in `@pantoken/components`' own `transition` utility now; this plugin only bakes the two\nduration/timing tokens into a token IR for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly."
msgstr "Själva CSS:en (basregeln `.instui-transition` plus tillståndsklasserna `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*`)\nlever nu i `@pantoken/components`s egen `transition`-verktyg; detta plugin bakar endast de två\nduration-/timing-tokensen in i en token-IR för konsumenter som använder den lägre nivåns `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens`-pipeline direkt."

