#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema Foundation for Sites med Instructure-tokener."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation är Sass-först, så detta paket levereras i två lager. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) genererar en\n`_settings`-stilad Sass-partial som pekar Foundations inställningsvariabler mot `var(--instui-*)`, så\nen Sass-build kompilerar Instructure-utseendet samtidigt som runtime-tematisering bevaras via samma anpassade\negenskaper. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) genererar ett tunt CSS-överlägg som tematiserar de vanliga kompilerade\nklasserna (`.button`, `.callout`, länkar) på samma sätt — användbart när du använder färdig Foundation CSS\noch bara vill lägga Instructure-färger ovanpå utan att kompilera om."

